  <p>
    I am a DJ, producer, multimedia artist, and tool builder living in Seattle,
    WA. I operate the record label
    <em><a href="https://illegalafter.party">`illegal afters tracks`</a></em>
    and co-founded the
    <em><a href="https://groundhum.net">Ground Hum</a></em> music festival. You
    may also know me by my other aliases: <em>'nohup'</em>, <em>'sighup'</em>,
    <em>DJ Kaaba Emoji</em>, <em>Wicked Lover</em> and more.
  </p>

  <p>
    I'm also the creator of <em><a href="/tempo-adjust">Tempo Adjust</a></em
    >, a set of browser extensions that help DJs detect and adjust the tempo of
    tracks on Bandcamp and Discogs, and some
    <a href="/tools">other tools for DJs</a>.
  </p>

